From df0ab059b80d0b696977bf4de4145fb02aaab968 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:47:22 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Sidebar server status: live Server and Caddy badges

Each server's dropdown now shows the real ping result (Online/Offline)
and Caddy admin API result (Running/Stopped), kept live by
nav-status.js along with the status dot. Removes the tooltip text, the
combined status labels and the unused header_nav_bar partial.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GFYvS9tgNsRjfuEB4vjX1t
